{"unit_id":"c4i890__dsh-wetflow#feature-1","repo":"c4i890/dsh-wetflow","commit":"23a92eb4bd29405ff4648afd5261bb619293957b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH–WetFlow 的功能「证据资料检索」：在当前实验运行中搜索已导入的资料片段并返回来源引用。Agent 可调用 wetflow_search_evidence 按关键词查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-78","wetflow/src/plugins/evidence.ts:10-25"]}
